ose undergoes hydrolysis, it results in the formation of invert sugar, a mixture of glucose and fructose. This change involves the inversion of optical rotation, which is where the term \"invert sugar\" comes from.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>नीचे दो कथन दिए गए हैं:</p>\n<p>कथन I: D-(+)- ग्लूकोस + D-(+) फ्रक्टोस <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.72ex\" height=\"2.58ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1140.3 2528.3 1140.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"undefined\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2192\" transform=\"translate(1638.3,0)\"></use><svg width=\"1708.3\" height=\"180\" x=\"0\" y=\"160\" viewBox=\"427.1 160 1708.3 180\"><use data-c=\"2190\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2190\" transform=\"scale(4.201,1)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mpadded\" transform=\"translate(0,683.2) scale(0.707)\"><g transform=\"translate(278,-200)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1964.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(2742.6,0)\"></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> सुक्रोस</p>\n<p>सुक्रोस <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.574ex\" height=\"3.217ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1172.1 8651.9 1422.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"undefined\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2192\" transform=\"translate(3941.7,0)\"></use><svg width=\"4011.7\" height=\"180\" x=\"0\" y=\"160\" viewBox=\"1002.9 160 4011.7 180\"><use data-c=\"2190\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-SO-2190\" transform=\"scale(9.865,1)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mpadded\" transform=\"translate(0,683.2) scale(0.707)\"><g transform=\"translate(278,-200)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> जल-अपघटन </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(6000,0)\"></g></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5109.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"44\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-44\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6095.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7095.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7484.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8262.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> ग्लूकोस <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.775ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 4320.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"44\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-44\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1764.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2764.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3153.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3931.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> फ्रक्टोस</p>\n<p>कथन II: अपवृत्त शर्करा सुक्रोस के जल-अपघटन के दौरान निर्मित होती है।</p>\n<p>उपर्युक्त कथनों के आलोक में, नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सही उत्तर चुनें:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":" कथन I और कथन II दोनों असत्य हैं।\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":" कथन I असत्य है, परन्तु कथन II सत्य है।\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":" कथन I और कथन II दोनों सत्य हैं।\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":" कथन I सत्य है, परन्तु कथन II असत्य है।"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>कथन I में दर्शाई गई अभिक्रिया गलत है। सुक्रोज के जल-अपघटन के दौरान, D-(+)-ग्लूकोज और D-(-)-फ्रक्टोज उत्पन्न होते हैं। हालांकि, कथन में गलती से D-(+)-फ्रक्टोज निर्दिष्ट किया गया है, जो कथन I को अशुद्ध बनाता है।</p>\n<p>कथन II सटीक है। जब सुक्रोज जल-अपघटन से गुजरता है, तो इसके परिणामस्वरूप प्रतिलोम शर्करा (invert sugar) का निर्माण होता है, जो ग्लूकोज और फ्रक्टोज का मिश्रण होता है। इस परिवर्तन में प्रकाशिक घूर्णन का प्रतिलोमन (inversion) शामिल है, जहां से \"प्रतिलोम शर्करा\" शब्द आता है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","timeAllotted":144000,"topic":"carbohydrates","type":"mcq","year":2025,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["assertion_reason"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are False\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is false but Statement II are true\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are true\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Statement I is true but Statement II is false"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>In Statement I, the reaction shown is incorrect. During the hydrolysis of sucrose, D-(+)-glucose and D-(-)-fructose are produced. However, the statement incorrectly specifies D-(+)-fructose, making Statement I inaccurate.</p>\n<p>Statement II is accurate. When sucrose undergoes hydrolysis, it results in the formation of invert sugar, a mixture of glucose and fructose. This change involves the inversion of optical rotation, which is where the term \"invert sugar\" comes from.</p>"}]}